# JasperGold formal scratch. run.sh puts EVERYTHING a run generates under
# formal/jgproject/<module>[_selftest][_ungated]/ - Jasper's own scratch, the
# console log, and the property summary - so this one line covers all of it.
formal/jgproject/
# a bare `jg` invoked from the repo root creates its own project dir
jgproject/
# Xcelium. xrun is the only simulator on CEPool - iverilog and verilator are not
# installed there - so running the shared testbenches drops these in whatever
# directory xrun was invoked from, which is usually the repo root.
xcelium.d/
xrun.log
xrun.history
xrun.key
INCA_libs/
.simvision/
waves.shm/
